{"id":"H7732","lemma":"שׁוֹבָל","transliteration":"shoval","sayIt":"sho-VAL","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shobal","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.20;\nson of: Seir (H8165B);\nbrother of: Lotan (H3877), Zibeon (H6649H), Anah (H6034H), Dishon (H1787), Ezer (H0687), Dishan (H1789) and Timna (H8555H);\nfather of: Alvan (H5935), Manahath (H4506B), Ebal (H5858B), Shepho (H8195), Onam (H0208)\n§ Shobal = \"flowing\"\n1) the 2nd son of Seir the Horite (Edom) and one of the dukes of the Horites\n2) son of Caleb, grandson of Hur, and founder of Kirjath-jearim\n3) a Judaite, son of Hur and a descendant of Caleb\n3a) possibly the same as 2","glosses":["shobal"],"count":9,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shobal","kjv":"and Shobal"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shobal","kjv":"of Shobal"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shobal","kjv":"Shobal"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":38,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shobal","kjv":"and Shobal"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":40,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shobal","kjv":"of Shobal"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":50,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shobal","kjv":"Shobal"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":52,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shobal","kjv":"And Shobal"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Shobal","kjv":"and Shobal"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shobal","kjv":"of Shobal"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:20","note":"These are the sons of Seir the Horite, the inhabitants of the land: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah,","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:38","note":"The sons of Seir: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1787","lemma":"דִּישֹׁן","transliteration":"dishon","gloss":"Dishon"},{"id":"H1789","lemma":"דִּישָׁן","transliteration":"dishan","gloss":"Dishan"},{"id":"H4506","lemma":"מָנַ֫חַת","transliteration":"manachat","gloss":"Manahath"},{"id":"H